 with its own set of challenges and gameplay modes.\n\nPlayers can choose from a wide variety of musical genres, from rock and classical to jazz and electronic, and engage in rhythm-based gameplay that tests both timing and creativity. The game\u2019s immersive virtual reality mechanics allow you to feel the beat and rhythm like never before, with intuitive controls that make playing complex songs or freestyling your own music both fun and accessible.\n\nPerfect for music enthusiasts, aspiring musicians, and VR gaming fans, Play Tune delivers an engaging and educational experience that brings the joy of music and gaming together. Whether you're a seasoned musician or a casual player, there's something for everyone in Play Tune, making it the ultimate VR music experience.", "short_description": "Play Tune is an immersive VR music game that lets players experience the thrill of playing a wide variety of musical instruments. Explore drums, guitars, pianos, and more, while engaging in exciting rhythm-based challenges. Perfect for music lovers and gamers alike, Play Tune offers a unique way to experience and interact with music in virtual reality."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"